    - target: {fileID: 5649587174976461374, guid: 2be12f8c25180574d8decb431753349d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\nThere are several ways to spawn particles, and when dealing with
        <b>strips</b>, this can have some implications for how you need to set up
        your VFX. This example shows you how to make a new <b>trail</b> for each
        periodic burst within a single system.\n\n<b>Covered Aspects</b>:\n\u2022
        Strip Output Context\n\u2022 Strip Index"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5762328778465116255, guid: 2be12f8c25180574d8decb431753349d, type: 3}
