    - target: {fileID: 5649587174976461374, guid: 0bdb812ac44b5d043a23d6208f6ab07c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\nYou can use <b>Strips</b>, also known as <b>Ribbons</b> or <b>Trails</b>,
        to create a wide range of VFX. The Strip Ouput Context and Strip particle
        data allow you to draw a quad between each particle. This example demonstrates
        a straightforward Strip setup. It explains the various strip properties and
        attributes that control its visual appearance and behavior.\n\n<b>Covered
        Aspects</b>:\n\u2022 Strip Output Context\n\u2022 Particle Index in Strip\n\u2022
        Particle Count in Strip\n\u2022 Strip Index"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5762328778465116255, guid: 0bdb812ac44b5d043a23d6208f6ab07c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
