    - target: {fileID: 5649587174976461374, guid: e8c50f0fc83841f499b893adf79a0e0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\nThere are several ways to spawn particles, and when dealing with
        <b>strips</b>, this can have some implications for how you need to set up
        your VFX. This example shows you how to make a single trail out of a continuous
        spawn rate of particles.\n\n<b>Covered Aspects</b>:\n\u2022 Strip Output
        Context\n\u2022 Strip Index\n\u2022 Attribute Locations"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
