      value: "\nIt's often really useful to be able to <b>rotate</b> particles. This
        VFX shows how to <b>rotate</b> particles thanks to the <b>Angle attribute</b>.\n\n<b>Covered
        Aspects:</b>\n\u2022 Rotation\n\u2022 Angle attribute\n\u2022 Pivot attribute"
