      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\nWhether the <b>Output</b> is set to Quads, Meshes, or even strips,
        we often want to control how to orient the geometry on a particle. Should
        it be <b>facing the camera</b>? What is the <b>forward</b> or <b>Up-Axis</b>?
        The Orient Block helps us to easily <b>orient</b> our particles as it comes
        with many handy modes. This example shows how to use the <b>Advanced Mode</b>.\n\n<b>Covered
        Aspects:</b>\n\u2022 Orient\n\u2022 AxisX AxisY AxisZ"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
